    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WALLS is a First person horror game featuring bizzare visuals, VHS camera, and bunch of eyes moving on the wall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A procedural generated singleplayer horror game. Stay focused, try not to get close to them. dodge 4 types of ghosts, locate the keys. Keys have different colors on each day. Look for the glowing light to find the keys.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DAY 1<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/474583bf1a5ba2af90ddee3ae28d9d8d.avif?t=1747445843\" width=448 height=886 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue - Don't get too close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DAY 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/e2e9f04656742b7406984798d1ee0c7c.avif?t=1747445843\" width=454 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow - Fastest ghost. be careful. you can collide with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DAY 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/5a1c347fd59c0fee6941c682a8ee9ce1.avif?t=1747445843\" width=448 height=678 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red - Biggest ghost. if you see them, get away as far as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/4838d5bfd2427290a1c6e82822dc927a.avif?t=1747445843\" width=324 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invisible - No movement. but, be careful. it's hard to see</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/182b5319ec964c9f03c7721c67c44584.avif?t=1747445843\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/9355eb9a61463aaed4b182194d63a876.avif?t=1747445843\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key - Try to find all the keys.</p>",
